src/moederncolbert_onnx/portable.py adapts the upstream inference architecture
into tensor-only operations for ONNX. Changes include explicit attention,
512-position RoPE buffers, dense evaluation of the eight experts with top-2
gating, and inclusion of the separate projection head and normalization.
